1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,500
When modern Beijing floods, this palace drains itself.

2
00:00:02,700 --> 00:00:04,600
I'm your China Travel Expert.

3
00:00:04,800 --> 00:00:08,300
First, the ground tilts: north high, south low.

4
00:00:08,600 --> 00:00:12,300
Carved dragon heads line every marble terrace.

5
00:00:12,500 --> 00:00:14,400
In a storm, they spit the rain out.

6
00:00:14,700 --> 00:00:18,700
It drains through over 15 km of channels.

7
00:00:18,900 --> 00:00:21,000
About 13 km of that runs underground.

8
00:00:21,300 --> 00:00:25,100
All of it feeds the Inner Golden Water River.

9
00:00:25,300 --> 00:00:28,400
Then straight out to the palace moat.

10
00:00:28,700 --> 00:00:30,900
★ Expert Tip: visit on a rainy day to watch it drain.

11
00:00:31,100 --> 00:00:32,500
Ancient drains or modern pipes — which would you trust?
